      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound and heavy realization, and you're not alone in feeling that cosmic insignificance. That vastness of time and space can make our daily struggles feel utterly meaningless, which is a very honest and understandable feeling. If the grand scale is so indifferent, then maybe the small, quiet moments of your own life are the only things that actually matter to you right now. Please consider letting yourself be as gentle with yourself as you would be with a small, fragile thing, and maybe reaching out to someone who can help you carry this weight.",
